    <item>
      <title>From Hesitation to Friendship</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/journals/week-2/varshini/</link>
      <pubDate>Fri, 09 Oct 2026 22:58:00 +0530</pubDate>
      
      <guid>http://localhost:1313/journals/week-2/varshini/</guid>
      <description>&lt;div class=&#34;journal-byline&#34;&gt;&#xA;  &lt;span&gt;🤝&#xA;  &lt;a href=&#34;http://localhost:1313/members/varshini-gudigar/&#34;&gt;Varshini Gudigar&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;  · POC Manager&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;  &lt;a class=&#34;journal-byline-back&#34; href=&#34;http://localhost:1313/journals/week-2/&#34;&gt;← Week 2&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;&lt;h2 class=&#34;relative group&#34;&gt;🤝 Varshini Gudigar&#xD;&#xA;    &lt;div id=&#34;-varshini-gudigar&#34; class=&#34;anchor&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;&#xA;    &#xD;&#xA;    &lt;span&#xD;&#xA;        class=&#34;absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none&#34;&gt;&#xD;&#xA;        &lt;a class=&#34;text-primary-300 dark:text-neutral-700 !no-underline&#34; href=&#34;#-varshini-gudigar&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#xD;&#xA;    &lt;/span&gt;&#xD;&#xA;    &#xD;&#xA;&lt;/h2&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;&lt;h3 class=&#34;relative group&#34;&gt;From Hesitation to Friendship&#xD;&#xA;    &lt;div id=&#34;from-hesitation-to-friendship&#34; class=&#34;anchor&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;&#xA;    &#xD;&#xA;    &lt;span&#xD;&#xA;        class=&#34;absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none&#34;&gt;&#xD;&#xA;        &lt;a class=&#34;text-primary-300 dark:text-neutral-700 !no-underline&#34; href=&#34;#from-hesitation-to-friendship&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#xD;&#xA;    &lt;/span&gt;&#xD;&#xA;    &#xD;&#xA;&lt;/h3&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;My second and third weeks as a Point of Contact (POC) Manager · POC Manager&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;&lt;h4 class=&#34;relative group&#34;&gt;Week 2: When the Silence Started to Break&#xD;&#xA;    &lt;div id=&#34;week-2-when-the-silence-started-to-break&#34; class=&#34;anchor&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;&#xA;    &#xD;&#xA;    &lt;span&#xD;&#xA;        class=&#34;absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none&#34;&gt;&#xD;&#xA;        &lt;a class=&#34;text-primary-300 dark:text-neutral-700 !no-underline&#34; href=&#34;#week-2-when-the-silence-started-to-break&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#xD;&#xA;    &lt;/span&gt;&#xD;&#xA;    &#xD;&#xA;&lt;/h4&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;After the first week of introductions and games, I wasn&amp;rsquo;t sure how much would change. What I noticed in the second week was a real shift. The students who had once stayed quiet started talking to us confidently, and they began asking their own questions.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
      
    </item>
    
